@piquark6046 there are ads.
```
m.megabox.co.kr#$#.ad-popup2 { display: none !important }
m.megabox.co.kr#$#.layer-dimmed { display: none !important; }
```
app promos
```
m.megabox.co.kr#$##mainAppInsPop { display: none !important }
m.megabox.co.kr#$#.induceBanner { display: none !important; }
m.megabox.co.kr#$#.modal-open { overflow: auto !important; }
```

